# renmark v0.2.4 — no API keys required
#
# renmark uses Claude Code's built-in models (Haiku, Sonnet, Opus) via the
# Agent tool and the Codex CLI for codex tasks. No API keys are needed here.
#
# If you add integrations (e.g. a custom OpenRouter endpoint), put them here
# and load them in renmark/providers/openrouter.py.

# Example — OpenRouter (optional, for custom model routing)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-your-key-here
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
